    "findings": [
      "String typing calls SAIVirtualKeyPress keyPressesForString from its async continuation.",
      "The converter searches virtual keys 0..127 across eight modifier configurations for each UTF-16 unit using the current keyboard layout.",
      "No matching key logs and advances to the next unit rather than injecting that unit directly.",
      "These instructions are consistent with the incomplete Chinese, emoji and combining-character input observed in this fixture."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "Full REA inspect-macho timed out at 180 seconds; native identity uses Mach-O load commands, nm and bounded LLVM instead.",
      "Raw-slice pseudocode has bad-instruction/tail-boundary warnings and includes adjacent code. Core loop and calls were checked against bounded 604-byte instructions and indirect symbols.",
      "Static path plus recipient observations do not prove that every input-method issue has this cause.",
      "The full native RPC type_text dispatcher-to-async-entry chain was not reconstructed. The converter call and mechanism are static facts; linkage to the observed missing characters is supported by recipient behavior, not captured private RPC."
    ],
    "symbolSizeDefinition": "Entry range up to the next distinct text symbol; not the extent of all async continuations."
  },
